   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s de ce projet comprennent: 1)  l&apos;accroissement de l&#x2019;&#xE9;radication  du poliovirus sauvage et &#xE9;radication de  toutes les &#xE9;pid&#xE9;mies de poliovirus d&#xE9;riv&#xE9; d&#x2019;une souche vaccinale; 2) l&apos;am&#xE9;lioration de l&#x2019;int&#xE9;gration de la poliomy&#xE9;lite gr&#xE2;ce au renforcement des syst&#xE8;mes de sant&#xE9;, la surveillance des maladies infectieuses &#xE9;vitables par la vaccination et la pr&#xE9;paration aux &#xE9;pid&#xE9;mies, et aux situations d&#x2019;urgence; 3)  le contr&#xF4;le des poliovirus et la confirmation d&apos;interruption de la transmission.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) increased interruption of wild poliovirus and stop all vaccine-derived poliovirus outbreaks; (2) improved polio integration through health system strengthening, vaccine-preventable disease and infectious disease surveillance, and outbreak and emergency preparedness; and (3) contained polioviruses and certify interruption of transmission.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
